<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merry Land rated neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merry Land rated neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber initiated coverage of Merry Land &amp; Investment Co Inc with a neutral rating, according to a PaineWebber source.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off 1/4 to 20-1/2 in morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
